{"seq":11,"trial_id":"v02-pilot-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-mu-v02-dev-perturn/ms-02-marrow-tickets/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T08:03:58.948Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"758e40c1c45ea6b75bd9fcb066d20d6d74fa3505c9b8238289b47e236c85f744","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","text":"@Hollis Mbeki, here's what I found for Thursday. I pulled from #central-team and Moss's public Central notes. I couldn't open the ticket or CRM folders for either account, so these statuses are as of the last mention in those sources and need checking in the ticket system before the review.\n\n**Marrow Agrisupply**\n- **PD-4821, Eastbank receiving-door import (setup):** The import file labels doors E1/E2, but their booking sheet uses 01/02. You said it needs fixing before anyone reimports, to avoid duplicates. Last mentioned 9 Jun 2026; you took setup/support.\n- **Pine Crossing appointment screen (support):** The screen shows the afternoon shift only, so the morning receiver can't book. You're checking the shift template and having support reproduce it with the store login. Last mentioned 9 Jun 2026.\n- **FR-882, feature request:** Custom pallet-jack icons on the Pemberline Dock yard map for their seasonal fertilizer sheds. Routed to the product backlog for Q2 review, per Moss's 2 Jan 2026 digest.\n\n**Marrow Fieldworks**\n- **#4409, Gatehouse Check-In report timeout (open):** Recurring timeout at their Salina North yard during the 06:00 flatbed intake, at Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron. From Moss's 2 Jan 2026 digest.\n- **#4412, driver SMS prompt glitch (open):** Minor. The prompt misfires when staging combine trailers on unpaved overflow lots. Same digest.\n\nMoss's digest calls these \"Pree's dealer account\" and doesn't name the account. I've matched them to Marrow Fieldworks because the same note says Fieldworks changes hands on 5 Jan 2026. Please confirm. Those two tickets are also from before the handoff, so they may have moved or closed since.\n\nNot included: the Tansley Packaging tickets (#88412 and the 2025 TP threads) are a different account. Moss's Central cheat sheet has a vague \"Marrow Agrisupply: door 4 msg\" note with no detail, so I left it out."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
